# Bizro dashboard env — all OPTIONAL now (D1-1 wiring: live-by-default).
#
# Leave VITE_API_BASE_URL unset and the app talks to SAME-ORIGIN /api:
#   - `npm run dev` proxies /api to http://localhost:8000 (see vite.config.ts)
#   - a production build served next to the server hits it directly.
# If a live call fails BEFORE any live call has succeeded (server down, wrong
# merchant id), the app falls back to clearly-labeled mock fixtures and the
# banner says so (STATUS.md D0-3). Point at another origin explicitly:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://bizro-server.example.com
# VITE_MERCHANT_ID=<merchant uuid from the server>
